   "k": "xvrdqw",
   "en": "Make sure to keep political power aside for the diplomatic annexation decisions. Put your spy on diplomatic pressure and pressure ⟦0⟧, gaining an non-aggression pact while doing the ⟦1⟧ focus. Then do the same with ⟦2⟧. Take ⟦3⟧ immediately after. Take the industrial bribery decision with ⟦4⟧ and then invite them to become an Austro-Hungarian Vassal. For ⟦5⟧, rally against them and do border exercises, and send them the invite to become a subject. ⟦6⟧ and ⟦7⟧ usually accept at \"Likely to accept\" threshold. Move your spy from ⟦8⟧ to ⟦9⟧ then ⟦10⟧ and offer non-aggression pacts to both. Improve relationships with the countries if need be. To maximize success with these three, take industrial bribery and joint military exercises before sending the invite to become a vassal. If time allows, do the same for Albania.",
