   "k": "1zzugc",
   "en": "Once ⟦0⟧ declares, focus on holding the forts, and feel free to call in ⟦1⟧, ⟦2⟧, ⟦3⟧, and ⟦4⟧ but do not call in ⟦5⟧. Take ⟦6⟧ and work towards ⟦7⟧ via renewing claims in Italy. It is worth getting a non-aggression pact with the soviet union throughout this to prevent going to war with them at the same time as ⟦8⟧. Take the decision to integrate/core all German states over time.",
