  {
   "k": "1oq1odq",
   "en": "While at war, try to encircle the tank divisions and fast moving divisions, this will help massively. If this is done, it becomes less risky to call in ⟦0⟧. Hold out until the allies join the war, at which point the axis can easily be defeated. By controlling as much German territory as possible during the war and integrating, they are cheaper to claim in the peace deal. If the axis is defeated before you can core all states, this should be ok as the German Republic should not be a puppet or subject of ⟦1⟧/ ⟦2⟧ and not part of the allies. You will have much more manpower and can edit the infantry templates and add artillery and anti-air as necessary, as well as Austrian Italy potentially. The ⟦3⟧ will then declare war. Build sufficient mobilized infantry to encircle the soviet forces. Declare war on the German Republic (using \"Annex Country\" as cause if possible) and overrun them, they will be weakened. They may join ⟦4⟧ at which point you will have to defeat Japan to end the war.",
   "frags": 5
  },
