   "en": "At some point, work towards the ⟦0⟧ to make annexing vassals easier. They will never promote to puppet from Austro-Hungarian vassal so do not worry about that. Work towards building up your military and annexing the territories after the war with the USSR, and proclaiming the ⟦1⟧. Should you still not be able to take all German territory, build up and prepare to attack the allies via ⟦2⟧. France should be relatively easy to capitulate via Austrian Italy, and then the allied German puppets should be small enough to overrun. Make sure to have defenses on the coast to prevent naval invasions.",
